{"name":"Raspberry Jelly Red","hex":"#9b6287","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"raspberry","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The plant Rubus idaeus.","Any of many other (but not all) species in the genus Rubus."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Containing or having the flavor/flavour of raspberries.","Of a dark pinkish red."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/raspberry"},{"term":"jelly","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dessert made by boiling gelatine (or a plant-based alternative such as agar or carrageenan), sugar and some flavouring (often derived from fruit) and allowing it to set.","A clear or translucent fruit preserve, made from fruit juice and set using either naturally occurring, or added, pectin."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make into jelly.","To preserve in jelly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/jelly"},{"term":"red","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The color of the setting sun, blood, and strawberries; the color which is evoked by the longest visible wavelengths (between about 625–740 nm), and a primary additive color.","A revolutionary socialist or (most commonly) a Communist;  a Bolshevik, a supporter of the Bolsheviks in the Russian Civil War."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a red hue.","Having an orange-brown or orange-blond colour; ginger."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/red"}],"entries":[{"title":"Raspberry","blocks":[{"text":"The raspberry is the edible fruit of several plant species in the genus Rubus of the rose family, most of which are in the subgenus Idaeobatus. The name also applies to these plants themselves. Raspberries are perennial with woody stems."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Raspberry_-_halved_%28Rubus_idaeus%29.jpg/330px-Raspberry_-_halved_%28Rubus_idaeus%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.